      "notes": "Real-time ETA covered via operator APIs (KMB / Citybus / GMB). GTFS scheduled-headway data (per-route per-time-window) is consumed by transport.plan_multimodal_journey via the OTP2 sidecar when running; not yet exposed as a dedicated headway-query tool."
